  "description": "The legal and social institution of marriage between two individuals of the same sex. Historically, this was not recognized in many jurisdictions, but has become increasingly accepted and legalized in many countries and U.S. states since the late 20th and early 21st centuries. The image of two women in wedding attire kissing is a visual representation of this institution, which is the central subject of the meme's message.",
